Caldera

is an automated adversary emulation tool designed to help security teams test and enhance 
their defenses. It provides the ability to simulate real-world attacker behavior utilizing 
the ATT&CK framework. This allows defenders to evaluate detection methods and practice 
incident response in a controlled environment. Caldera supports offensive and defensive 
operations, making it a powerful tool for red and blue team exercises.

https://caldera.mitre.org/
